      <title>Pothole Partnership calls for five-year pothole warranty</title>
      <link>https://www.highwaysmagazine.co.uk/news/dft/pothole-partnership-calls-pothole-warranty</link>
      <description>The Pothole Partnership has called for a minimum five-year warranty on every non-emergency pothole repair, with any defect found during that time being repaired at no additional cost.</description>
